    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Galvin Property are delighted to bring No. 22 Park Drive Grove to the open market for sale. This spacious two-bedroom mid-terrace property enjoys a great location, with off-street parking and a sizeable rear garden.\r\n\r\nThe front door opens into a spacious living room, with stairs to the first-floor landing and understairs storage. The living room leads through to the kitchen/diner, which has a door out to the rear garden. Upstairs, there are two generously sized double bedrooms and a family bathroom. Bedroom one is a sizeable double with a window to the front, while bedroom two is again a sizeable double, with a window to the rear. The family bathroom is fitted with a Velux roof light. To the front, there is ample & private space for off-street parking.\r\n\r\nThe location is excellent, with Castleknock Village and all its amenities just a short stroll away. A good selection of primary schools is within walking distance, including the ever-popular St Brigid's National School (school admission policies are subject to change and should be verified independently). Transport links are excellent too, with Castleknock Train Station just a five-minute walk away and a number of Dublin Bus routes on hand. The M50 is a two-minute drive, making trips into the city and further afield easy.\r\n\r\nWhile the property requires full refurbishment, it offers a new owner a blank canvas to create a stunning home in a highly popular area.\r\n\r\nContact us on 01 4964612 to arrange a viewing."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Walking distance to Castleknock Village and Phoenix Park\r\nOff street parking\r\nGFCH\r\nClose to public transport (Bus & Train)"
      },
